{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044850/extras/44542ef182902fcdabea70d1157f7fa4.avif?t=1760489746\" width=296 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WZRDS is a Horde Survival Roguelite where you play as a wizard with powerful spells and abilities. Mix and match weapons and set bonuses, choose between dozens of items, create unique and powerful builds, and survive against waves of powerful spirits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044850/extras/e87d02fbd3dcd0c00950aa4c03464e65.webp?t=1760489746\" width=300 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over a dozen different weapons to choose from</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon scales from multiple elemental stats, allowing them to fill different roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of each weapon makes you experiment with different weapon combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix, Match, and optimize Set Bonuses to unlock your weapon's full potential\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has a powerful level 3 skill to unlock and experiment with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044850/extras/195a1033dfc81da9ef8be8fe66413e80.webp?t=1760489746\" width=300 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Different WZRDS to choose from, each with their own</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active abilities</strong>: Powerful spells with long cooldowns that can change how you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passives</strong>: Constant modifiers that change the efficacy of the different weapons and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item sets</strong>: Each wzrd has a different item pool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocks</strong> : Multiple unlocks per character keep you coming back for more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044850/extras/e79337055d7d01e462c7c3be9712f860.webp?t=1760489746\" width=300 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-40 minute runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies over 20 waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Powerful Bosses to take down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ladder-Ascension difficulty system to climb</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044850/extras/df41fde7c4ee4b8add16c135e3e383e6.webp?t=1760489746\" width=100 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo offers the complete WZRDS experience, but with reduced content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 less weapons to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 less general items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 less character items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 less unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 less difficulty tiers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044850?t=1760489746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044850/f3af0acd0a492aa94ef1f885ffd927dde2e802bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760489746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044850/c608acd6ab71137b1504150cdfa22edc129df9aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760